WEBVTT

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.810
They're coming after us?

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:09.980
It looks like continuing the
concert will not be possible.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.610
No!

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:12.950
But it's our first concert!

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.240
Everyone is waiting for us down there!

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.700
Even if we die—

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.910
Death is <i>not</i> something to take lightly!

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:27.750
But if we leave Lancastar now,

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:31.840
won't it fall completely back
under the Entertainment Ban?

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.380
She's right.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:39.600
If we retreat now, we may never be able to return.

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:43.850
<i>We may never be able to return?</i>

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.940
<i>I'd never see them again.</i>

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:48.400
<i>I couldn't...</i>

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.110
I couldn't live with that!

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:51.280
Orine.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:54.990
We haven't reached the people of Lancastar yet!

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:56.280
Exactly!

00:00:56.280 --> 00:01:02.040
I wanted my family and Mamoru to see our concert.

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:06.580
Anyway, we'll be rendezvousing with the <i>Katyusha</i>.

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:08.040
Tsubasa-san!

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:23.470
- For Their Smiles-

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:28.650
Docking with the <i>Katyusha</i> complete.

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:30.320
Our pursuers have given up.

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:35.530
Keep an eye out for threats in the current sector.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:36.200
Yes, ma'am.

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:38.740
<i>I understand.</i>

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:42.790
<i>I wouldn't want to abandon my home planet either.</i>

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:44.790
<i>However...</i>

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:46.660
<i>Mariko.</i>

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.460
<i>You're so timid, Mariko.</i>

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:50.590
<i>That's not it.</i>

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:52.050
<i>I just don't see the point of it.</i>

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:55.010
<i>The point?</i>

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:58.930
<i>Think about it. There are no WOTA on this planet.</i>

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:00.760
<i>Nobody there is waiting for us.</i>

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.810
<i>Why should we go see them?</i>

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.220
<i>I see.</i>

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:08.560
<i>I guess I view it differently.</i>

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:16.740
<i>Maybe </i>you<i> go to see people
because they're waiting for you,</i>

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:17.900
<i>but not me.</i>

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:22.620
<i>I go because </i>I<i> want to see them.</i>

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:25.040
<i>Acchan...</i>

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:31.040
What should I do?

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:41.590
That scared Sonata.

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:47.770
I know DES hates us. I know they're our enemies.

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:48.480
But...

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:54.520
His face looked so scary when he said he hated us.

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:57.030
Sonata...

00:02:57.030 --> 00:03:03.780
I thought 00 was full of smiles, happiness, and love.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:09.290
But it is.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:11.540
00 is a place full of love!

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:14.630
<i>They're</i> wrong for hating us!

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.090
DES are just a bunch of bullies.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:19.220
You need to hold your head high, Sonati!

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:22.680
S-Suzuko's mad.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.930
I always wanted to return to Lancastar.

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:30.600
Chieri?

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:38.400
I haven't forgotten the summer we spent together as children.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:44.070
Time and again, I wished that I could go back.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:49.580
I want to hold a concert on Lancastar...

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:54.540
for my own sake as much as anyone else's.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.720
Where are you going?

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:04.590
Yuuko.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:09.430
Going to ask her personally to continue the understudy performance on Lancastar?

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:13.310
You don't have to spoon-feed those girls.

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:15.810
They need to pull through with their own power.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:16.770
But—

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:18.150
I'll come with you.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:24.530
I know you're set on letting
Kanata take over as Takamina.

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:29.040
If this is gonna be your last concert,

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:32.830
then you may as well go out with a bang!

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:34.290
Yuuko...

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:43.470
<i>"Because </i>I<i> want to see them," huh?</i>

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:46.430
<i>Yes. That's also why...</i>

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.260
<i>That's also why...</i>

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:49.810
<i>I'll open the door.</i>

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.270
Tsubasa-san!

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:54.100
You girls!

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:57.560
Please, let us resume the understudy concert!

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.110
It's too dangerous! DES will capture you!

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:01.780
We want to go see them!

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.780
Please, let them go!

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.820
Please!

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:07.820
Tsubasa-san!

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.990
I agree!

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:09.030
Tsubasa-san!

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.080
What's going on?

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:12.750
I don't know.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:15.790
<i>You want to reach them, don't you?</i>

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:19.290
<i>You want to reach them.</i>

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:21.670
Acchan?

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:25.130
<i>You want to go see them, don't you?</i>

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:25.130
That's Acchan's voice!

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.550
<i>So that your feelings may reach them.</i>

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:27.510
That voice...

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.100
It's Acchan!

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:30.300
We want to go back!

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:33.640
So our feelings will reach them!

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:36.520
So do we! We want to reach them!

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:41.070
What's happening?

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.570
The Kirara Drive field is extending to the planet's surface.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.610
Acchan...

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.780
Are you doing this?

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:52.240
<i>Go and reach them.</i>

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.450
<i>Go and cast your radiance...</i>

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.710
<i>across the land!</i>

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:04.550
Calm down, everyone!

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.510
That light...

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.890
The radiance of the Kirara?

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.850
Listen up! Head for that light!

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:27.950
If you want to see 00's concert, turn
towards that light and run like the wind!

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:30.410
Halt, you scum!

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:38.040
Acchan...

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:45.050
You're always there to light the way for us.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:42.670
That was Acchan's voice?

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:43.230
Yeah.

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:44.280
Where is she?

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:45.050
Acchan's here?

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.220
Really?

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:48.290
What's going on?

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:48.590
We're going in!

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:50.300
The party's about to start!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.760
Roger!

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:04.000
AKB0048!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:09.780
Music?

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.320
This song...

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.280
A concert at the detainment facility?

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.660
They're insane!

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:20.500
But there's no better place to fight
for the liberation of entertainment!

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:23.250
Right on!

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.210
There's no stopping 00's song!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.300
Hey, Chief.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:31.130
If we're doing this, why don't we do it in style?

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.510
Thought you'd never ask!

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:38.310
That's right! Run with all your might!

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:39.770
Shout at the top of your lungs!

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:44.620
AKB0048!

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.950
Everybody! We're back!

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:18.890
You run past,

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:23.520
<i>Chieri...</i>

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:25.020
splashing as you go.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:25.100
What?!

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:32.320
I left my sandals lying on the white sand.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:28.190
00?

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:35.280
Come on, boys! Go and get a better view of the concert!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:39.620
The rolling waves bring in summer with the surf.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:39.740
Halt!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:42.710
This barefoot romance

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:41.910
Do you realize what you're doing?!

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:45.120
will carry me anywhere.

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:48.630
This is what I longed for

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.710
Motomiya's father, I presume.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.960
Yes. And you are?

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:50.920
at seventeen.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.630
Let's go. Hurry!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.470
But...

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:56.260
This is Nagisa-san's very first performance.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:57.300
As I run away

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.850
Be there for her!

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:03.560
come chase after me!

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:10.570
Nagisa, you sing.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:19.450
I kept thinking I didn't want to lose to you.

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:25.000
But I realized we wouldn't reach
anyone if we were against each other.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:28.170
Go on, let your feelings reach out

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:30.040
to all the people of Lancastar!

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.840
Nagisa-chan!

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:34.920
Chieri-chan! You're so cute!

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:36.050
Nagisa! Nagisa!

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:37.760
Nagisa...

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:39.680
<i>Mommy...</i>

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:40.720
Look over here!

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:43.890
Nagisa...

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:46.350
Da...ddy...

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:47.560
Nagisa!

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:50.560
I'll... sing.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:02.240
I listened closely

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:04.580
to the ocean of your heart.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.840
As I run away

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.000
Nagisa!

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:12.880
The Kirara split in two!

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:14.340
Nagisa!

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:17.050
come chase after me!

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:16.050
Cherry!

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:18.630
Thank goodness! Her voice came back!

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:19.680
Yeah.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:23.560
You run past,

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.690
splashing as you go.

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:30.770
Nagisa...

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:37.780
Dear...

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:52.420
All right, girls!

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:55.630
That leaves the encore! Let's bring on the new song!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:56.130
Yeah!

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:04.560
<i>Come. Let's begin.</i>

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.770
<i>Our sweat and tears will bring about</i>

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:08.980
<i>a brand new dream.</i>

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:13.900
It's the song they've been saving.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.870
The stars that shine in the night sky

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.870
yoru no sora kagayaku hoshi wa

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.460
lie billions of lightyears away.

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.460
nanoku kounen no kanata

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:28.000
Even if the depths of despair

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:28.000
tatoe fukai zetsubou ga

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.500
should cast an endless shadow,

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.500
mugen no yami to nattemo

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:33.130
the truth will make itself heard.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:33.130
shinjitsu wa tsutawaru nda

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:35.800
Who shall be the one to receive

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:35.800
jikan no kawa ni takushita

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:38.140
the message of light

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:38.140
sono hikari no messeeji

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:40.550
set adrift on the river of time?

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:40.550
uketoru mono wa dare dai?

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.840
That light...

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:45.680
People are born, and people die.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:45.680
hito wa umarete hito wa shinde yuku

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:50.150
Our bodies don't last forever.

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:50.150
nikutai wa horobiru yo

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:55.820
Those who rise back up from the ashes

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:55.820
hai no naka kara yomigaeru mono wa

00:11:55.820 --> 00:12:01.530
give passion to the next generation.

00:11:55.820 --> 00:12:01.530
jounetsu tsugi no sedai e

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.110
That radiance!

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:04.910
Dreams are like reincarnation.

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:04.910
yume wa reincarnation

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:09.830
Like déjà vu, my distant memories

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:09.830
nando demo deja vu no you na

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:12.330
At Acchan's final concert,
the Kirara glowed brilliantly.

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.500
keep coming back to me.

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.500
tooi kioku

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:15.670
It's just like reincarnation.

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:15.670
marude reincarnation

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:18.250
Why? It's not just Nagisa and Chieri.

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:20.050
With my head still in the clouds,

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:20.050
ima mo mata muishiki no uchi ni

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:21.670
Every single understudy is radiant.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:24.260
I'm running off somewhere again.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:24.260
dokoka e hashitteru

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:31.270
Will enough tears make me give up?

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:31.270
ikutsume no namida de akirameru no ka?

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:32.730
Nagisa, you're doing wonderfully.

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:37.320
Will enough lives make my dream come true?

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:37.320
ikutsume no inochi de kanau mono nano ka?

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:40.990
Oh no!

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:42.530
What?!

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:47.070
Are you all right?

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:49.330
Yes!

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.040
Put that down, Chieri.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:54.580
This new song means a lot more.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.920
Takamina-san and the others will handle defense.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:01.800
We'll go into spatial formation to decentralize their attacks.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:02.760
Kanata!

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:06.510
Roger that, Captain!

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:08.470
Captain!

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:14.020
Will enough farewells make me turn my back?

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:14.020
ikutsume no wakare de senaka mukeru ka?

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:20.220
Will enough experiences bring us together?

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:20.220
ikutsume no deai de motomeau mono ka?

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:20.190
Amazing.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:24.610
Kanata truly <i>is</i> the next generation's Takamina.

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:25.610
Come on, everyone!

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:29.830
We need to lend all our
radiance to their performance!

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:30.780
Takamina...

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:32.580
But never forget:

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:35.210
We are AKB0048.

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:38.170
We don't fight. We show them our love!

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:41.090
It's my generation!

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:41.090
watashi no sedai!

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:45.170
Dreams are like reincarnation.

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:45.170
yume wa reincarnation

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:49.720
Like déjà vu, my distant memories

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:49.720
nando demo deja vu no you na

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:51.430
keep coming back to me.

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:51.430
tooi kioku

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:51.970
Is she... singing?!

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:55.560
It's just like reincarnation.

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:55.560
marude reincarnation

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:56.190
You there! Don't move!

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:59.980
With my head still in the clouds,

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:59.980
ima mo mata muishiki no uchi ni

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:58.940
Yuuko!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:13:59.690
Takamina!

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:03.400
I'm fine. It's just a scratch.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:04.150
I'm running off somewhere again.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:04.150
dokoka e hashitteru

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.400
A Kirara.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:11.200
Will enough tears make me give up?

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:11.200
ikutsume no namida de akirameru no ka?

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.360
Why are the holy grounds...?

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:17.250
Will enough lives make my dream come true?

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:17.250
ikutsume no inochi de kanau mono nano ka?

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:17.580
The Kirara of Succession have chosen
Takamina as Takahashi Minami again!

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:23.800
Her strong desire to protect the
members and the concert above all else

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:27.220
has resonated with the soul of
the original Takahashi Minami.

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:29.890
Takahashi Minami is still Takamina.

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.640
So what of Kanata?

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:38.480
<i>Center Nova... Center Nova...</i>

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:42.360
<i>Center Nova... Center Nova...</i>

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:43.980
Center Nova?

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:46.860
Does he mean one of these girls?

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:03.250
Even if you reach out your hand,

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:03.250
