Heart attack!

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.500
atsuku

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:52.550
If you find yourself broken down in tears,

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:52.550
kimi ga namida ni kureteiru nara

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:48.670
Mommy!

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:53.050
You're safe now.

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:58.010
then rather than consoling you,

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:58.010
nagusame yori mo yagate shiramu

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:54.970
It's Mimori-chan.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:55.510
Up you go.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:56.930
yagate

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:58.010
shiramu

00:15:58.010 --> 00:16:04.310
let me speak of the coming dawn.

00:15:58.010 --> 00:16:04.310
sora wo katarou ka

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:06.230
Go Yuuka

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:06.230
Nagisa

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:09.610
Get down!

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:11.610
Mommy!

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:13.450
Nagisa!

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:21.750
I want to protect them!

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:23.370
Nagisa!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.130
Chieri?

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:26.670
All right!

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:32.130
Kirara!

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.050
Amazing!

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:39.390
The micsabers' output is through the roof!

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:44.690
Launcher: Ready.

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:46.690
Ammo feed system: Go.

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:47.690
Rapid-fire.

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:57.160
Mayuyu spanked them good!

00:16:58.620 --> 00:16:59.410
Go on, girls.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.500
We'll take care of it from here.

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.370
Get back to your concert!

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:05.080
Okay!

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:11.570
Let me speak of hope,

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:11.570
kibou ni tsuite boku wa katarou

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:12.590
<i>Nagisa...</i>

00:17:11.570 --> 00:17:17.750
like a nameless poet: with passion.

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:15.870
you ni

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.390
<i>We can feel it!</i>

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.100
<i>Our song.</i>

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:23.800
If you ever doubt yourself,

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:23.800
kimi ga kotae ni mayotteru nara

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.060
<i>Everyone's feelings.</i>

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:23.310
<i>They're resonating and becoming one.</i>

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:29.720
just keep walking without hesitation.

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:29.720
tachidomarazu ni arukinagara

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.020
So this is entertainment.

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:28.180
aruki

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:29.720
nagara

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:36.060
Let me speak of hope.

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:36.060
kibou ni tsuite boku wa katarou

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:41.390
Like a nameless warrior, someday,

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:41.390
na mo naki senshi no you ni itsuka

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:40.280
you ni

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:41.240
What's happening?

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:41.390
itsuka

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:47.820
I'll live for my dreams.

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:47.820
yume wo kate ni shite

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:46.580
No!

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:47.670
Stop, please!

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:52.590
If you glow any brighter...

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:08.400
Thank you very much!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:15.690
The Center Novae...

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:21.700
Where are you now?

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:32.040
We made it by the skin of our teeth.

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:39.010
But if one of those girls shall be the next Center Nova,

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:43.010
then I swear, I'll bring the truth to light.

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:53.230
The sparkles in this sand...

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:54.980
Dualium?

00:18:55.440 --> 00:19:00.200
Is that why the Center Nova
phenomenon occurred here?

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:03.990
Mommy!

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:04.950
Nagisa!

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:07.870
Mommy!

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:10.420
I missed you so much.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.710
You were wonderful, Nagisa.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:15.960
Really?

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:17.210
Yes.

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:19.170
Dear!

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:22.590
Daddy...

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.850
I'm sorry. I...

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:30.690
Why are you apologizing?

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:36.940
Are your convictions so weak that you can apologize them away?

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:39.440
That's...

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.830
Acting captain, calling all hands.

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:51.210
DES reinforcement fleet detected in the upper atmosphere.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:53.710
To avoid putting the fans in any more danger,

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:55.290
I'm ordering an immediate retreat.

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:57.840
We're retreating already?

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:00.260
But I'm finally seeing you again!

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:01.260
Go.

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:05.510
You already abandoned this planet once.

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:11.440
If your feelings are that strong, then this is no time to falter.

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:13.690
Daddy...

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:18.020
Be safe, Nagisa.

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:20.530
Thank you, Mommy!

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:21.990
Thank you, Daddy!

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:35.330
Don't turn back!

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:37.750
Keep your eyes in front of you and move forward!

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:41.210
Daddy... Mommy...

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:45.220
"Life is all about farewells."

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:45.220
"sayonara dake ga jinsei nanda" tte

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:49.010
Someone once said those words.

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:49.010
itsuka dareka ga itteta kedo

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.020
But if that's all there is,

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.020
sore dake ja

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:55.770
then why did we meet to begin with?

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:55.770
shiriatta imi ga nai ne

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:58.570
All people are travelers

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:58.570
hito wa nando mo

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:00.530
who meet and part

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:00.530
deai to wakare wo

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:04.200
in a never-ending cycle.

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:04.280
kurikaeshiteru tabibito da yo

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:01.860
Mamoru.

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:02.820
Yuuka...

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.530
Each time they gain

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:06.530
omoide to

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:07.450
But I...

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:11.040
memories and new guiding lights.

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:11.040
michishirube te ni ireteru

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:19.960
Come on, don't you look at me

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:19.800
nee sonna ni kanashii me de

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:15.210
I'm going now.

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:23.970
watashi wo mitsumenaide yo

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:23.880
with those tearful eyes of yours.

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:28.970
Let me see your smile.

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:28.970
egao misete

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:34.140
I know that I'll see you again,

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:34.140
kanarazu kimi ni aeru kara

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:36.690
Tsubasa-san. Did something happen?

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:37.770
someday, somewhere out there.

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:37.770
itsu no hi ka dokoka de

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:41.730
Believe in the power of fate

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:41.820
unmei ga hikiyoseru

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:45.860
chikara shinjite

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:45.780
to bring us together.

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:43.940
Takamina!

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:49.660
I know that I'll see you again,

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:49.660
kanarazu kimi ni aeru kara

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:48.360
Go Yuuka

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:48.360
Nagisa

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:51.330
so until that day,

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:51.330
sono hi made

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:57.250
don't you ever forget about me.

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:57.250
watashi wo zutto wasurenaide

00:21:57.250 --> 00:22:01.040
It's a promise.

00:21:57.250 --> 00:22:01.040
yakusoku yo

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:34.330
The sunlight awaits at the windy station.

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:34.330
kaze no eki de matteru hizashi

00:22:34.330 --> 00:22:40.170
The clouds form a path in the sky.

00:22:34.330 --> 00:22:40.170
sora wo wataru kumo no senro

00:22:40.170 --> 00:22:45.670
I glance briefly at my watch

00:22:40.170 --> 00:22:45.670
boku wa tokei wo chirari nagamete

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:52.300
and gently heave a sigh.

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:52.300
sotto shinkokyuu shita nda

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:57.100
Is someone holding you back, saying "don't go"?

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:57.100
kimi wa yuku na to hikitomerareteru no ka

00:22:57.100 --> 00:23:02.770
Can you leave your love behind?

00:22:57.100 --> 00:23:02.770
ai wo furikireru ka

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:08.530
The rainbow train is about to depart,

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:08.530
niji no ressha ga jikoku doori ni

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:14.200
right on schedule, toward our dreams

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:14.200
yume ni mukatte shuppatsu suru yo

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:19.790
I want to set off with you by my side.

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:19.790
kimi to issho ni tabidachitai nda

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:26.710
Cast everything aside and let's go!

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:26.710
subete sutete yatte koi
